{
  "nid": "description",
  "order": 1,
  "localTask": [
    {
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "把一个对象说完整"
    },
    {
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "Describe one object fully"
    }
  ],
  "name": [
    {
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "描述"
    },
    {
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "Description"
    }
  ],
  "description": [
    {
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "先说出要写的是谁或什么，再把它的样子和特点写清楚，最后可以补一句感受。"
    },
    {
      "lang": "en",
      "text": "First name who or what you are writing about, then add how it looks or what it is like, and you may end with a feeling."
    }
  ],
  "difficulty": {
    "max": 3,
    "min": 0
  },
  "blueprints": [
    {
      "nid": "description_micro",
      "name": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "短描述"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "A Short Description"
        }
      ],
      "description": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "先说出这是什么，再补一两句它什么样。"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "First say what it is, then add one or two details about it."
        }
      ],
      "paragraphTypeNid": "description",
      "difficulty": {
        "max": 1,
        "min": 0
      },
      "order": 1,
      "minSentenceCount": 2,
      "maxSentenceCount": 4,
      "slots": [
        {
          "order": 1,
          "beatNid": "opening",
          "required": true,
          "repeatMin": 1,
          "repeatMax": 1,
          "allowedDiscourseRoleNids": [
            "standalone_sentence",
            "scene_setting"
          ],
          "allowedFamilyNids": [
            "identity_and_state",
            "existence_and_quantity"
          ],
          "allowedPairTypeNidToNext": "support_upgrade",
          "jobName": [
            {
              "lang": "zh",
              "text": "点出对象"
            },
            {
              "lang": "en",
              "text": "Name the object"
            }
          ],
          "jobDescription": [
            {
              "lang": "zh",
              "text": "先把要写的对象点出来：这是谁、是什么，或你眼前看到的是哪一件。读完这一句，别人就知道这段在写什么。"
            },
            {
              "lang": "en",
              "text": "First name what you are writing about: who it is, what it is, or what you see in front of you. After this sentence, a reader should know what this paragraph is about."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "order": 2,
          "beatNid": "develop",
          "required": true,
          "repeatMin": 1,
          "repeatMax": 2,
          "allowedDiscourseRoleNids": [
            "supporting_detail"
          ],
          "allowedFamilyNids": [
            "identity_and_state",
            "existence_and_quantity",
            "location_and_time",
            "action_and_experience"
          ],
          "allowedPairTypeNidToNext": "support_upgrade",
          "jobName": [
            {
              "lang": "zh",
              "text": "写样子特点"
            },
            {
              "lang": "en",
              "text": "Add how it looks"
            }
          ],
          "jobDescription": [
            {
              "lang": "zh",
              "text": "接着写它的样子、特点或常在做什么。用看得见、听得到的细节把这个对象立住，不要另起一个话题。"
            },
            {
              "lang": "en",
              "text": "Then write how it looks, what it is like, or what it often does. Use details you can see or hear, and stay with this one thing."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "order": 3,
          "beatNid": "turn",
          "required": false,
          "repeatMin": 0,
          "repeatMax": 0,
          "allowedDiscourseRoleNids": [],
          "allowedFamilyNids": [],
          "allowedPairTypeNidToNext": null,
          "jobName": [
            {
              "lang": "zh",
              "text": "举个例子"
            },
            {
              "lang": "en",
              "text": "Give an example"
            }
          ],
          "jobDescription": [
            {
              "lang": "zh",
              "text": "如果还要再写，就补一个具体的例子或一个特别的地方，让前面那些特点落到一件真事上。"
            },
            {
              "lang": "en",
              "text": "If you write more, add a concrete example or one special detail so the earlier points land on something real."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "order": 4,
          "beatNid": "close",
          "required": false,
          "repeatMin": 0,
          "repeatMax": 1,
          "allowedDiscourseRoleNids": [
            "concluding_sentence",
            "opinion_statement"
          ],
          "allowedFamilyNids": [
            "plan_and_intention",
            "comparison_and_evaluation"
          ],
          "allowedPairTypeNidToNext": null,
          "jobName": [
            {
              "lang": "zh",
              "text": "收一句感受"
            },
            {
              "lang": "en",
              "text": "End with a feeling"
            }
          ],
          "jobDescription": [
            {
              "lang": "zh",
              "text": "可以收一句你的感受、喜好，或它为什么值得一写。不写也可以，别在这里突然换成别的东西。"
            },
            {
              "lang": "en",
              "text": "You may end with a feeling, a preference, or why it is worth writing about. You can skip this beat, but do not switch to something else."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
