              ],
              "description": [
                {
                  "lang": "zh",
                  "text": "这一组句型帮助学习者比较不同人和事、说出自己更偏向哪一个，并让读者看懂差别到底在哪里。"
                },
                {
                  "lang": "en",
                  "text": "This group helps learners compare people or things, show preferences, and make it clear what is better, different, or more suitable."
